# ==============================================================================
# This repository holds OUR OWN engineering content: netlists, testbenches,
# checkers, SKILL, scripts, reports and small numeric results.
#
# It must NEVER hold a foundry/instructor PDK, vendor model card, DRC/LVS deck,
# credential, SSH key or token. Not in a commit, and not in history.
#
# The gate is not this file -- .gitignore only hides things from `git status`.
# scripts/precommit_safety_check.py is what refuses a commit, and it also re-checks
# full history before any push. Install it with scripts/install_hooks.sh.
# ==============================================================================

